WEBVTT

00:03:27.963 --> 00:03:31.863
I think they were the ones
who actually pivoted very rapidly

00:03:31.897 --> 00:03:35.563
and came up with those early
vaccine programs,

00:03:35.597 --> 00:03:38.930
which were then quickly
partnered with Big Pharma.

00:03:39.530 --> 00:03:44.730
So Big Pharma actually then decided
to basically invest and license

00:03:44.730 --> 00:03:46.863
and develop these programs

00:03:46.897 --> 00:03:50.063
and take it to global markets
because, you know,

00:03:50.097 --> 00:03:55.697
they felt that it was Big Pharma
that had the kind of necessary networks

00:03:55.730 --> 00:04:01.097
and supply chains to deliver those
vaccines efficiently to global markets.